mes he was rear ended. The last one was just recently when an old lady was backing out of a bank. She backed right into my brother’s backside because there was snow on her back window and she could not see him. He was stuck in the parking lot behind a guy waiting for another diver to move from his space. <P>These are some of the reasons why I say snow s__ks and I hate winter.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm about 6'2" so the snow is 20-24" tall and thats in the city.<BR>PS. Don't call me Short.<p>[This message has been edited by baldlobo (edited 01-01-2001).]||||reg||6
